{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25813","headline":"新楼诗二十首 海榴亭 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首 海榴亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海榴亭早开繁蘂，光照晴霞破碧烟。\n高近紫霄疑菡萏，迥依江月半婵娟。\n怀芳不作翻风艳，别萼犹含泣露妍。\n摇落旧丛云水隔，不堪行坐数流年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}